---
layout: "base.liquid"
title: Contributions
permalink: "/contributions/{% if pagination.pageNumber > 0 %}{{ pagination.pageNumber | plus: 1 }}/{% endif %}index.html"

pagination:
  data: contributions
  size: 500
  resolve: values
nav: opensource
header_kicker: Open Source · log
header_title: Contributions
---

<section id="contributions" class="page">
  <h2>Contributions - Page {{ pagination.pageNumber | plus: 1 }} of {{ pagination.pages | size }}</h2>

  <p class="intro">
    This report includes data sources which can be queried automatically.
    Of course there are many contributions which can't be tracked automatically,
    so they have been omitted here. Most data sources are related to Mozilla.
    Most notably this doesn't include emails, chat messages, ad-hoc meetings
    or working documents that never got posted on discussion forums. There are also
    comments on confidential bugs, such as budget requests and Reps applications,
    which will not show up here.
  </p>

  {% if pagination.pageNumber == 0 %}
    {% include "../_includes/activity.html" %}
  {% endif %}

  <nav class="pagination" aria-label="Contributions pages, top">
    {% if pagination.href.previous %}
      <a href="{{ pagination.href.previous }}"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Previous Page</a>
    {% endif %}

    {% if pagination.href.next %}
      <a href="{{ pagination.href.next }}">Next Page <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    {% endif %}
  </nav>

  <table class="contributions">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Date</th>
        <th>Type</th>
        <th>Description</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for contribution in pagination.items %}
        <tr>
          <td>{{ contribution.createdAt | date: "%Y-%m-%d" }}</td>
          <td>
            {% if contribution.link == "" %}
              {{ contribution.type | escape }}
            {% else %}
              <a href="{{ contribution.link | escape }}">{{ contribution.type | escape }}</a>
            {% endif %}
          </td>
          <td>{{ contribution.description | escape }}</td>
        </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <nav class="pagination" aria-label="Contributions pages, bottom">
    {% if pagination.href.previous %}
      <a href="{{ pagination.href.previous }}"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Previous Page</a>
    {% endif %}

    {% if pagination.href.next %}
      <a href="{{ pagination.href.next }}">Next Page <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    {% endif %}
  </nav>
</section>
